OL,3,A'Well-known' man asks court to stop
OL,4,Apublication of sexual offence
OL,5,Aallegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn individual described as "well-known"
OL,8,Fhas asked London's High Court to
OL,9,Fprevent two media organisations from
OL,10,Fpublishing "serious allegations",
OL,11,Fincluding of a sexual nature, against
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,FThe court heard he had submitted
OL,15,Fmedical evidence saying that if the
OL,16,Fallegations were made public this would
OL,17,F"almost certainly" lead to him
OL,18,F"attempting to take his own life", and
OL,19,Fthat the prospect of publication had
OL,20,Falready led to two suicide attempts.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
