OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Well-known' man asks court to stop
OL,4,Apublication of sexual offence
OL,5,Aallegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe court was told that Independent
OL,8,FTelevision News and Guardian News &
OL,9,FMedia had carried out an investigation
OL,10,Finto the individual's "conduct over a
OL,11,Fperiod of years".
OL,13,FThe individual, who has been granted
OL,14,Fanonymity in the court proceedings,
OL,15,Fdenies the allegations.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
